feat(vendors): phone + full socials on the vendor profile

The vendor profile form was missing the phone field and only had Instagram +
Website. Add the phone number and a full set of socials — X (Twitter),
Facebook, TikTok, LinkedIn, YouTube, and WhatsApp — end to end:

- schema: six new nullable columns on user (migration 0019, additive).
- vendor.profile get/update + input now carry phone, whatsapp and the five new
  social URLs.
- the profile form renders inputs for all of them (WhatsApp/phone as numbers,
  the rest as profile URLs), prefilled from and saved back to the server.
- public /vendors/[id] surfaces them: public.vendors.byId returns the socials
  and the profile's Contact / Social Media panel links each one that's set
  (WhatsApp rendered as a wa.me link).
